 `src/index.ts`.
 
 Prices are integer cents everywhere. Run the tests with `npm test`.
+
+## Discount codes
+
+Customers can give an order one discount code at a time; a second code replaces the first. An order's totals show
+the discount as `discountCents`, and its `totalCents` is the items minus the discount plus the shipping.
+
+- `SPRING10` takes 10 % off the items, rounded to the nearest cent (a half cent rounds up).
+- `WELCOME5` takes 5.00 € off the items, on an order whose items come to 30.00 € or more.
+
+Apply a code with `orders.applyCode(orderNumber, code)`. An unknown code, or `WELCOME5` on a smaller order, is refused
+with the reason and the order is left as it was. The discount never touches shipping: whether an order ships free is
+decided on its items before any discount.
